  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad6b4272890c70c4eb3d3dfe4810ac24, type: 3}
  m_Name: D_Vane_03
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Morsoul.Dialogue::Morsoul.Dialogue.DialogueData
  id: D_Vane_03
  nodes:
  - id: vane_greeting
    speakerName: Vane
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (Polite, clean-shaven man in high-collared scholarly robes, calmly examining a specimen vial of murky gray fluid) "Greetings, travelers. If you are seeking passage into the deeper grove, I strongly advise turning back. The fungal contamination within the hollow has agitated the local dryads beyond rational diplomacy."
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: eliza_guild
  - id: eliza_guild
    speakerName: Eliza
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (Eyes narrowed, resting a hand on her daggers) "We aren't travelers. Investigator's Guild. And you seem awfully composed for a man sitting fifty paces away from an ecological disaster."
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: vane_scholar
  - id: vane_scholar
    speakerName: Vane
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (Chuckles smoothly, adjusting iron-rimmed spectacles) "A man of science cannot afford hysterics, Lady Investigator. I am Master Vane, accredited fellow of the Provincial Botanical Directorate. I am conducting a <color=#E5A93C>sanctioned ecological survey to isolate this aggressive botanical rot before it spreads to agricultural timber.</color>"
    registersClue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f6cf69c5df6784446952989bd6f7d76e, type: 2}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: golem_scan
  - id: golem_scan
    speakerName: Golem
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: '[OPTICAL SCAN: Subject heart rate: 58 BPM (Abnormally calm). No biological field sampling reagents present on workbench.]

      "Observation: Your laboratory lacks sterile incubation baths, fungal culture mediums, or spore isolation glassware. Your equipment consists entirely of high-pressure fluid valves and empty heavy-duty iron transport drums."'
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: vane_hardens
  - id: vane_hardens
    speakerName: Vane
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (Expression hardens for an instant before smoothing into a patronizing smile) "Heavy-duty sampling requires heavy-duty storage, automaton. Ancient trees do not yield delicate sap. Now, if you will excuse me, my research permits grant me exclusive surveying rights inside the inner sanctum."
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: eliza_warrant
  - id: eliza_warrant
    speakerName: Eliza
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: '"Your permit doesn''t supersede a Class-A Guild Warrant. Step aside, ''Scholar.'' {PlayerName}, scan the gate."'
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: 
  startNodeId: vane_greeting
  portraits: []
